{
	"nodes":[
		{"id":"5c46e8e5eb7d1653","type":"group","x":-1360,"y":-640,"width":2860,"height":1640,"color":"4","label":"CSAPP CHAPTER 1 MAPPER "},
		{
			"id":"972facccc7e4a7e3",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"Introduces you to GCC compiler and peeks into transforming source code to executable and compilation phase",
			"styleAttributes":{},
			"x":-500,
			"y":-583,
			"width":260,
			"height":85
		},
		{
			"id":"ff2997379ad2d71c",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"Explores about the introduction on CSAPP books and highlights the skills that can  be earned by reading it",
			"styleAttributes":{},
			"x":-990,
			"y":-576,
			"width":260,
			"height":80
		},
		{"id":"bf4e6c6cecbbcc00","type":"file","file":"My Knowledge Base/Programming/Compiler/A Tour of Computer Systems - Chapter 1 CSAPP.md","x":-1260,"y":-322,"width":400,"height":400},
		{"id":"106535dd2e88c362","type":"file","file":"My Knowledge Base/Programming/Compiler/How GCC works under the hood -  CSAPP Chapter 1.md","x":-700,"y":-322,"width":400,"height":400},
		{"id":"536d2ba8bc85c715","type":"file","file":"My Knowledge Base/Programming/Compiler/Why it's important to understand the compilation system.md","x":-140,"y":-322,"width":400,"height":400},
		{
			"id":"1fd64717a5b2c7a6",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"Explains the importance of grasping the compilation phase of the compiler and how we would benefit it from  ",
			"styleAttributes":{},
			"x":-70,
			"y":-600,
			"width":260,
			"height":118
		},
		{
			"id":"dd3b71ebf98aef5f",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"A brief explanation how the computer hardware work together to execute executable or object file of the hello world program  under the hood",
			"styleAttributes":{},
			"x":380,
			"y":-587,
			"width":290,
			"height":101
		},
		{
			"id":"90ed2a535cd8175f",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"Ann overview of how CPU, RAM and DISK and Shell work together to run the hello world program in bare metal",
			"styleAttributes":{},
			"x":940,
			"y":-587,
			"width":260,
			"height":110
		},
		{"id":"bea2f721d157abf4","type":"file","file":"My Knowledge Base/Computer Science/Computer Systems/Operating Systems/Running a simple Hello World Program.md","x":940,"y":-322,"width":400,"height":400},
		{"id":"f7e73d156df128ba","type":"file","file":"My Knowledge Base/Computer Science/Computer Systems/Computer Architecture/Hardware Organization of a Typical System.md","x":380,"y":-322,"width":400,"height":400},
		{
			"id":"f2236add06689a7c",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"Shows the memory hierarchy pyramid that shows each relations of memory storages to each other",
			"styleAttributes":{},
			"x":-540,
			"y":230,
			"width":300,
			"height":80
		},
		{
			"id":"07d11e80aa9c570e",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"Explains what a cache memory is and a brief glimpse to memory hierarchy",
